  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Enhancement sphere, Illusion sphere (Illusionary Touch (sensory, touch) x2).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may enhance any illusions you create as if they were actually the creatures and objects they appear to be. Parts of the illusion can be enhanced separately - you could use the Enhance Equipment enhancement to grant an illusionary soldier an enhancement bonus to attack and damage rolls with its non-existent spear. Additional damage from enhanced illusions deal nonlethal damage of their type (nonlethal fire damage, nonlethal bleed damage, etc.) unless your illusions are dealing lethal damage because of another talent, feat or ability (such as the Shadow Infusion talent).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement#toc87\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
